### Pruebas rápidas desde Visual Studio Code (extensión "REST Client"): clic en "Send Request" sobre cada petición.
### Para la batería completa con aserciones use postman/TechSupport-SOA.postman_collection.json

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Login CLIENTE
# @name loginCliente
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "cgonzalez@techsupport.pe", "password": "Cliente123!" }

### 2. Login TECNICO N2
# @name loginTecnico
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "lramirez@techsupport.pe", "password": "Tecnico123!" }

### 3. Login ADMIN
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@techsupport.pe", "password": "Admin123!" }

@cliente = {{loginCliente.response.body.accessToken}}
@tecnico = {{loginTecnico.response.body.accessToken}}
@admin = {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Registrar incidencia CRÍTICA (se asigna de inmediato)
# @name critico
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Caída total del ERP", "description": "El ERP no responde en producción.", "category": "BASES_DATOS" }

@ticketId = {{critico.response.body.ticketId}}

### 5. Ver el ticket (mire la cabecera X-Cache: MISS / HIT / STALE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente}}

### 6. Mis tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets/client/USR-C0001
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente}}

### 7. Técnico inicia el diagnóstico
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{tecnico}}

### 8. Escalar a N3
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/escalate
Authorization: Bearer {{tecnico}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Se requiere reinicio de instancia a nivel de infraestructura" }

### 9. Bitácora del ticket
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### 10. Técnicos disponibles para BD nivel N2
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/technicians/available?specialty=BASES_DATOS&level=N2
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### 11. Cola de espera
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### 12. Crear ticket con la BD de tickets caída → 503 rápido
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Prueba", "description": "Con BD caída", "category": "SISTEMAS_SOFTWARE" }

### 13. Logout (revoca el token del cliente)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente}}
